d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"水仙花","author":"朱诚泳","text":"玉骨冰肌别样春，凌波步小袜生尘。\n风来水面香飞处，疑是当年解佩人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":51818,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"子陵画","author":"朱诚泳","text":"汉庭辞却大夫官，七里滩头一钓竿。\n千古富春岩畔月，清光常映客星寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":51819,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"子牙画","author":"朱诚泳","text":"兴周有兆信非熊，老奋鹰扬策上功。\n渭水无人能枉驾，鬓毛落尽钓丝风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":51820,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花 其一","author":"朱诚泳","text":"贞心如铁傲霜风，不与群芳斗紫红。\n记得罗浮春梦醒，翠禽嘈杂月明中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":51821,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花 其二","author":"朱诚泳","text":"黄昏庭院雨丝丝，春到东南第几枝。\n凭仗东君好呵护，莫教人向笛中吹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":51822,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雁字","author":"朱诚泳","text":"暮云飞尽碧天长，万里横斜字一行。\n月白夜寒风力劲，断文零落下潇湘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":51823,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雁影","author":"朱诚泳","text":"才背斜阳过戍楼，又拖明月度沧洲。\n一行飞向天南去，印破湘江万里秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":51824,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"孤雁","author":"朱诚泳","text":"一声嘹呖过南楼，烟水茫茫万里秋。\n多少弟兄零落尽，且随鸥鹭立沧洲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":51825,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻雁","author":"朱诚泳","text":"满空寒雨度潇湘，楚水燕云道路长。\n惆怅故人千里别，好传尺素过衡阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":51826,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元夜宴永寿府","author":"朱诚泳","text":"埙篪迭奏两情欢，宝烛银屏敌夜寒。\n最是无边风景好，丁宁莫向醉中看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":51827,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"天马词","author":"朱诚泳","text":"神骏遥从大宛来，追风万里绝驽骀。\n天闲不用争刍秣，苜宿花香处处开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":51828,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"塞上词","author":"朱诚泳","text":"漠漠黄沙隔汉关，西风狐兔满西山。\n喧阗笳鼓随烽火，知是将军夜猎还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":51829,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春阴 其一","author":"朱诚泳","text":"一番风雨暗清明，绿满閒庭草自生。\n十二楼台都倚遍，燕莺帘外寂无声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":51830,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春阴 其二","author":"朱诚泳","text":"黯黯阴云入望低，落花飞絮尽沾泥。\n眼前风物催春晚，满地蘼芜长欲齐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":51831,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]